.Ss Issues, questions, and TODO cleanup
.Ss Issues fixed
\fBDuplicate dired icons\fP — removed
.Ql "nerd-icons-dired"
use-package block from
.Ql "init-ui.el" .
Dirvish already renders nerd-icons via
.Ql "dirvish-attributes '(nerd-icons ...)"
in
.Ql "init-navigation.el" ;
the extra hook was causing both to fire simultaneously, producing two identical icons per entry.
.Pp
\fBRelative line numbers\fP — removed
.Ql ":custom (display-line-numbers-type 'relative)"
from the
.Ql "display-line-numbers"
block in
.Ql "init-ui.el" .
Line numbers remain active in
.Ql "prog-mode" Ns No "/" Ns Ql "conf-mode"
but now use the default absolute style.
.Ss Question answered
\fBpackage-quickstart\fP
.No \&( Ns Ql "questions.md" )
— explained what the feature does and why
.Ql "package-quickstart-file"
is pinned to
.Ql "var/package-quickstart.el"
in
.Ql "early-init.el"
(must be set before
.Ql "startup.el"
runs
.Ql "package-activate-all" ).
.Ss TODO cleanup
